	"_comment": [
		"Hand-written Armenian. HikaShop's own hy-AM file covers 42 of the app's 520 strings, so",
		"almost all of this is written here.",
		"Armenian counts in two, and Intl puts 0 in the one bucket, so both forms have to read",
		"naturally with any number in front of them.",
		"Marked needs-native-check, and meant literally: this was written without a native speaker",
		"reading it. It gives a merchant their own words rather than English, which is worth more",
		"than nothing, but it is the language here I can vouch for least. Corrections go in this",
		"file; run tools/build-locales.mjs and the app picks them up."
